{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52075","headline":"杂言诗 · 谢偃","name":"杂言诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉辰令月欢无极，万岁千秋乐未央。\n（见《日本古典文学大系》七三册收日人藤原公任一○一八年左右纂《和汉朗咏集》卷下《祝》。\n）（按：题据川口久雄校注引架藏私注本。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谢偃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}